          "text": "8月12日，中國上海新世界城發生一起鬥毆，其中一人拿出小刀猛刺對方數刀。最後被警方逮捕帶走。\n8/14被刺的傷者大量內出血死亡。\n許多中國網民說寧願帶刀捅死人也別當那個死人。\n你怎麼說？\n\nOn August 12th, a fight broke out at the New World City shopping mall in Shanghai, China, during which one person pulled out a knife and stabbed the other multiple times. He was eventually arrested and taken into custody by police.\n\nOn August 14th, the stabbed victim died from massive internal bleeding.\n\nMany Chinese netizens commented that they would rather carry a knife and kill someone than be the one who dies.\n\nWhat do you think?"
